4.10.3 Company Each Party shall have the right, in its sole discretion and without liability, to review and approve or to request modification of such schedules by November 1 of each year.  The Parties shall endeavor to reach agreement on any such requested modifications by December 1 of each year, provided that neither Party shall have an obligation to agree to the other Party's requests for modifications if to do so would, in such Party's sole discretion, have an adverse effect on such Party.
(a)  Each Party shall use its best commercially reasonable efforts to accomplish all planned outages Scheduled Maintenance Outages in accordance with the approved schedule.
