4.10.4 Regardless of any prior approval of a planned outage schedule, Generator or its Agents
4.10.4 Neither Party shall not start a planned outage Scheduled Maintenance Outage on its facilities without reconfirming the approval of the Company outage with the other Party immediately prior to the start of such planned outage. Following such reconfirmation, the Company shall advise Generator of any conditions arising that may preclude such planned outage. In such event, the Parties shall coordinate any needed adjustments to the planned outage schedule. Scheduled Maintenance Outage, provided that Generator shall not be required to reconfirm periods when the Facility is available but not operating.
